# This is a data repository. Nothing here may be line-ending translated.
# The CSV dialect pins UTF-8 with LF; git's default autocrlf would rewrite it to CRLF
# on checkout and silently corrupt every row's last field.
* -text

# Belt and braces, per type, in case someone later adds a text file and assumes otherwise.
*.csv    -text binary
*.json   -text
*.graphml -text
*.md     -text
*.txt    -text
